===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|informal|countable}} A [[bump]] on the [[head]].
# {{lb|en|informal|countable}} Any minor collision or blow.
# {{lb|en|informal|countable|chiefly|UK}} An act of sexual intercourse.
#* {{RQ:Hollinghurst Line|chapter=2|passage=“{{...}} It’s not like I’m just looking for a '''bonk''', is it? This is something a bit different.” ¶ “Quite,” said Nick—though '''bonk''' was a troublingly casual way of referring to something which preoccupied him so much.}}
